sequenceDiagram
 actor Donor
 participant React
 participant API as Express API
 participant V as Validation and auth middleware
 participant S as Donation workflow
 participant P as Demo payment simulator
 participant ORM as Prisma
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 Donor->>React: Submit campaign and gift
 React->>API: POST /api/donations
 API->>V: Apply security and Zod checks
 V->>S: Valid request
 S->>ORM: Create pending donation and attempt
 S->>P: Simulate payment
 P-->>S: Success or failure + reference
 alt Success
 S->>ORM: Transaction: success, totals, receipt, audit
 ORM->>DB: Commit
 else Failure
 S->>ORM: Record failed status; no receipt
 ORM->>DB: Commit failure attempt
 end
 API-->>React: Donation outcome and receipt if successful
 React-->>Donor: Display result
